<title>MEXICO: Ece 1997 Q1 net profit falls.</title>
<headline>Ece 1997 Q1 net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997			Q1 1996</p>
<p>	Shr		  n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>	Net		  37.39 million		39.67 million</p>
<p>	Revs		 136.67 million	     137.03 million</p>
<p>	Oper Income	46.21 million		47.58 million</p>
<p>	Integ fin cost   2.11 million	 gain  3.86 million</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>		Full company name is Ece SA de CV.</p>
<p>((--Dan Trotta, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9507))</p>
